```lean
/-- **Toy compactness theorem (finite families, explicit enumeration).** -/
theorem toyCompactness_finiteFamily {n : ℕ} (F : Fin n → PointedMetricSpace)
    [∀ i, Fintype (F i)] (u : ℕ → Fin n) :
    ∃ (i : Fin n) (φ : ℕ → ℕ), StrictMono φ ∧
      GHConvergenceData atTop (fun k => F (u (φ k))) (F i) := by
  obtain ⟨i, φ, hφ, hconst⟩ := exists_strictMono_const_of_fin u
  refine ⟨i, φ, hφ, ?_⟩
  have : (fun k => F (u (φ k))) = fun _ => F i := by funext k; rw [hconst k]
  rw [this]
  exact GHConvergenceData.refl (F i) atTop
```
`GHConvergenceData.refl (X) (l) : GHConvergenceData l (fun _ => X) X`. Good.

